{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15218100","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15218100","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1521810001:1":{"text":"페르세우스... 드디어 네 방패를 찾았어.","source_cn":"珀尔修斯……我终于找到你的盾牌了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAE60B30587F3A316","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:1::2":{"text":"망가진 방패","source_cn":"破损的盾牌","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBAF480311E5EC160","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1521810002:2":{"text":"윽...! 무, 무거워.","source_cn":"唔……！好、好沉。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34D54FBE6A29D9F8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1521810002":{"text":"윽...! 무, 무거워.","source_cn":"唔……！好、好沉。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34D54FBE6A29D9F8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1521810003:0":{"text":"내, 내가 할 수 있어!","source_cn":"我、我拿得动！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x72AA80F206D67A6E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1521810004:1":{"text":"이걸 보칼리스로 가져가면 페르세우스의 <style=\"highlight\">장례식을 준비</style>할 수 있을 거야.","source_cn":"等我带它回到呼临城，就可以开始为珀尔修斯<style=...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4BD99C8738D5C86A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1521810005:1":{"text":"보칼리스의 전통에 따라서, 생전에 쓰던 물건을 함께 묻을 수 있거든. 이 물건들이 페르세우스를 영원히 지켜줄 거야...","source_cn":"按照呼临的传统，逝者生前用过的东西可以用来陪葬。它会陪...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C76FA419583A07C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1521810006:0":{"text":"...이제, 휴전 협정을 체결하러 돌아가도 돼.","source_cn":"……现在，我、我们可以回去签署停战合约了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF08737A82792D7B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1521810007:0":{"text":"좋아. 멍청하고 전쟁에 미친 보칼리스인들과는 다르군.","source_cn":"很好。你和那些蠢笨的呼临好战者不一样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x18BDC8F62DCD9744","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:12:1521810007":{"text":"좋아. 멍청하고 전쟁에 미친 보칼리스인들과는 다르군.","source_cn":"很好。你和那些蠢笨的呼临好战者不一样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x18BDC8F62DCD9744","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1521810008:0":{"text":"강한 힘은 장점입니다.","source_cn":"强大的实力是优点。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE1C28DC2C17DC17","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1521810009:0":{"text":"하지만 자기 분수를 모르면, 어리석을 뿐이지요!","source_cn":"但不自量力，就是愚蠢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4D222022380D3214","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1521810010:1":{"text":"알겠어요... 다시는 이 땅에 전쟁이 일어나는 비극은 없을 거예요. 페르세우스의 희생을 헛되게 해서는 안 되니까요.","source_cn":"我明白……不会再有战争了。我不会让珀尔修斯白白牺牲。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD9C2CF0462E7A4D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1521810011:1":{"text":"휴전 협정을 맺은 뒤에, 원한다면 페르세우스의 장례식에 참석해도 좋아요.","source_cn":"等停战合约签署后，如果你愿意，也可以来参加珀尔修斯的葬礼。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFCF39654801744B2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1521810012:0":{"text":"말도 안 되는 소리.","source_cn":"不可能。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE749646A618006FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1521810013:0":{"text":"휴전은 휴전이다. 페르세우스를 훌륭한 적수로 인정하는 것과 별개로, 녀석은 아쿠보르의 원수지.","source_cn":"停战是停战，我承认珀尔修斯是合格的对手，但他也是雅库伯...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x01E1A7D96379FD19","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1521810014:0":{"text":"아쿠보르인은 원수의 장례식에 참석하지 않는다. 페르세우스의 방패를 가져가라. 이제 <style=\"highlight\">협정을 체결하러 돌아가지</style>.","source_cn":"雅库伯尔人，不会参加仇敌的葬礼。带走他的盾牌。<sty...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x43FB39B8191CCFF8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:12:0:1":{"text":"도토리 키재기 아닌가?","source_cn":"你居然说别人好战？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x6E63D89848403FA2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"도토리 키재기 아닌가?","female":"도토리 키재기 아닌가?","variant_male_record_index":"78813","variant_female_record_index":"78814","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:12:1:2":{"text":"호전적인 건 아쿠보르인 아니야?","source_cn":"好战者是指雅库伯尔人？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4F92ADF2E75FAF5C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"호전적인 건 아쿠보르인 아니야?","female":"호전적인 건 아쿠보르인 아니야?","variant_male_record_index":"78815","variant_female_record_index":"78816","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:5:0:1":{"text":"도와줄까?","source_cn":"需要我帮忙吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4B7A06D92153E7E8","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"도와줄까?","female":"도와줄까?","variant_male_record_index":"78809","variant_female_record_index":"78810","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:5:1:2":{"text":"그게 꼭 필요한 모양이네","source_cn":"你好像很需要它","status":"matched_runtime_gender